InterviewKing GDPI Preparation for MBA Admissions
InterviewKing is a focused GDPI preparation hub for MBA aspirants preparing for Group Discussion, Written Ability Test, Personal Interview, SOP writing, profile building, current affairs and college-specific interview rounds. The homepage connects students to the five most important InterviewKing resources: GDPI syllabus, G Strategy skill builders, GDPI experiences, PI questions and the Cetking GDPI program.
GDPI Syllabus, WAT, SOP and Case Study Preparation
The GDPI syllabus route helps students structure preparation across introduction, achievements, Why MBA, career goals, hobbies, interests, strengths, weaknesses, WAT essay writing, SOP building, case studies, group activities, current affairs, business news, geopolitical awareness and technical knowledge. This gives students a clear interview preparation roadmap before B-school calls begin.
PI Questions, GDPI Experiences and G Strategy Skill Builders
The PI questions route supports answer practice for HR questions, specialization questions, fresher interviews, gap-year interviews, work-experience interviews, finance, marketing, commerce, engineering and common MBA admission questions. The GDPI experiences route helps students learn from real IIM, NMIMS, XLRI, SCMHRD, SIBM and other MBA interview processes. The G Strategy route strengthens resume, profile, SOP, spoken English, current affairs and manager-like communication for the final convert.
